OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment websites offline over
OL,4,Ahacking concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe States of Guernsey has taken some
OL,7,Fwebsites offline temporarily as a
OL,8,Fprecaution after "international
OL,9,Fwarnings about a security weakness in
OL,10,Fwidely-used web software", officials
OL,11,Fsay.
OL,13,FSites taken offline include the
OL,14,Fgovernment site, its revenue service
OL,15,Fportal, its post-16 education site, the
OL,16,Fsite for the Beau Sejour leisure centre
OL,17,Fand the booking platform scuba.
OL,19,FThe States said cybersecurity experts
OL,20,Fhad identified weaknesses in software
OL,21,Fused in some websites and IT experts
OL,22,Fwere checking a new fix.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
