OL,3,GNEWSAGovernment websites offline over
OL,4,Ahacking concerns
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said: "We have no evidence that any
OL,7,Fof our websites have been affected. We
OL,8,Fare acting early because it is the
OL,9,Fsafest way to protect the public and
OL,10,Four systems while the fix is applied
OL,11,Fand tested."
